<header>
	<h1>Tasks are a reminder system for agents</h1>

	<p>
	 Agents can use tasks to keep track of pieces of work they need to do beyond resolving tickets. Agents can assign tasks to each other.
	</p>
</header>


<article>
	<section>
		<p>You can enable or disable the agent interface Tasks app for all agents.
		</p>
		<p>Alternatively, you can allow tasks only for certain agent permission groups or agents.
		</p>
		<p>The <strong>Send agent task reminders at</strong> setting only applies to agents who have chosen to receive <strong>A task assigned to me is due today</strong> notifications.</p>
	</section>
